WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
23 people, cars hold 4.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.830
How many cars?

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:08.560
23 ÷ 4 is 5, remainder 3.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.000
But 3 people can't be left behind.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.850
You need 6 cars.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:15.170
The remainder decides the answer.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:21.013
Check: 5 cars of 4 is 20, + 3 is 23.
